---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import OrnamentFrame from '../components/OrnamentFrame.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About"
  description="OH! Signs LLC — a small sign shop that makes things in-house and takes the work seriously."
>
  <section class="page-hero section-y">
    <div class="container about-hero">
      <div class="about-hero-content">
        <p class="text-label" style="color: var(--color-smoke); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">About Us</p>
        <h1 class="text-h1" style="color: var(--color-cream); margin: 0 0 1.25rem;">We're OH! Signs.</h1>
        <p class="about-lead">
          A small sign shop. Everything is made here — no outsourced printing, no mystery vendors,
          no three-week delays while your files travel across the country.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-hero-frame" aria-hidden="true">
        <OrnamentFrame>
          <div class="about-frame-inner">
            <p class="about-frame-quote">"Serious about the work,<br/>not ourselves."</p>
          </div>
        </OrnamentFrame>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-story section-cream section-y">
    <div class="container about-story-inner">
      <div class="about-story-content">
        <h2 class="text-h2">The short version.</h2>
        <p>
          We started OH! Signs because we kept seeing the same problem: businesses paying too much
          for mediocre work, waiting too long to get it, and being treated like a small fish in a
          big print-shop pond.
        </p>
        <p>
          We don't have a massive production floor. We have a tight team, good equipment, and a
          habit of caring about the details more than we probably should. That combination tends
          to produce better results faster than operations that treat your job as ticket #4,782.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you've ever received a sign and thought "this isn't what I pictured" — that's the
          problem we're here to fix.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-story-values">
        <h2 class="text-h2">How we work.</h2>
        <dl class="values-list">
          <dt>In-house production</dt>
          <dd>We own our equipment and control our output. No middlemen, no blame-shifting.</dd>

          <dt>Files reviewed before print</dt>
          <dd>We check your art before it runs. Better to spend 5 minutes catching a problem than to reprint an entire order.</dd>

          <dt>Honest turnaround times</dt>
          <dd>We tell you what's realistic. Rush jobs happen — we'll tell you when we can and can't do one.</dd>

          <dt>Clear pricing</dt>
          <dd>Quoted price is the price. No hidden fees when the invoice arrives.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-cta section-y">
    <div class="container">
      <OrnamentFrame class="about-cta-frame">
        <div class="about-cta-inner">
          <h2 class="text-h2">Ready to work together?</h2>
          <p>Start with a quote request, or just email us if you have questions.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 1rem;">
            <a href="/quote" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="mailto:hello@ohsigns.shop" class="btn btn-outline">hello@ohsigns.shop</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </OrnamentFrame>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero { background-color: var(--color-ink); }

  .about-hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 4rem);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .about-lead { color: var(--color-smoke); font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.125rem); max-width: 52ch; margin: 0; }
  .about-hero-frame { flex-shrink: 0; color: var(--color-cream); }
  .about-frame-inner { padding: 1rem; max-width: 260px; }
  .about-frame-quote {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.125rem);
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-cream);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  .about-story { background-color: var(--color-cream); color: var(--color-ink); }
  .about-story-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .about-story-content .text-h2 { margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .about-story-content p { color: #5a6050; margin: 0 0 1rem; max-width: 52ch; }

  .about-story-values .text-h2 { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
  .values-list { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
  .values-list dt { font-weight: 700; font-size: var(--text-sm); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
  .values-list dd { margin: 0; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: #5a6050; }

  .about-cta { background-color: var(--color-ink); }
  .about-cta-frame { max-width: 560px; color: var(--color-cream); }
  .about-cta-inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; }
  .about-cta-inner .text-h2 { margin: 0; }
  .about-cta-inner p { margin: 0; color: var(--color-smoke); }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-hero  { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .about-hero-frame { display: none; }
    .about-story-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
